@startuml j8-payment-screenshot
title J8 Payment screenshot: attach, shrink, read the amount, the owner saves
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantFontColor #0B3D2E
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorFontColor #0B3D2E
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  DividerFontColor #0B3D2E
  BoxBorderColor #0E5C45
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner" as Owner
participant "Browser UI\n(index.html)" as UI
participant "app.js" as App
database "localStorage" as LS
participant "CDN library\n(Tesseract.js 5.1.1, jsDelivr)" as CDN
autonumber
Owner -> UI : in the entry form, Choose screenshot (#shot-input, accept image/*)
UI -> App : change: onShotChange()
alt file is not an image
  App -> UI : #entry-msg "That file is not a picture."; clear the input
else image
  App -> UI : set type to Payment
  App -> App : FileReader.readAsDataURL(file)
  App -> App : draw on a canvas: longest side at most 640 px, white background
  App -> App : shotData = canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg', 0.72)
  App -> UI : preview the picture
  App -> App : readAmount(original data URL)
  App -> UI : #ocr-msg "Reading the amount from the screenshot..."
  App -> App : loadTesseract()
  alt window.Tesseract not loaded yet
    App -> CDN : add script cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tesseract.js@5.1.1/dist/tesseract.min.js
    CDN --> App : window.Tesseract
  end
  App -> CDN : createWorker(language by app language:\nhi 'eng+hin', te 'eng+tel', all others 'eng');\nread as scattered text, if no amount once more as one block
  opt the combined language fails to load
    App -> CDN : createWorker('eng'), the same two reads
  end
  CDN --> App : text
  note right of CDN : language data is downloaded on first use\nand is not cached for offline
  App -> App : qNorm(text): Devanagari and Telugu digits to 0 to 9
  App -> App : pickAmount(text): the largest number after ₹, Rs, INR, amount, paid,\nरु, रुपये, राशि, రూ, మొత్తం or భుగతాన;\nelse the largest plain number that is not a year
  alt amount found
    opt Amount field empty, or last filled by the reader
      App -> UI : put the amount into Amount
    end
    App -> UI : "Read Rs {amt} from the screenshot. Check it before saving."
  else no amount, or the script or the reading failed
    App -> UI : "Could not read an amount from this picture. Type it in."
  end
end
note right of UI : typing in Amount stops the reader\nfrom overwriting it
Owner -> UI : check the amount, press Save entry
UI -> App : onEntrySubmit() (checks as in J2)
App -> App : entry.shot = shotData (the small JPEG)
App -> LS : save(): the picture is stored inside 'hisaab.v1'
opt storage is full
  App -> UI : toast "Storage is full. Export a backup, then remove some screenshots."
end
App -> UI : render(): the entry shows img[data-shot]
opt remove the picture (#shot-clear)
  App -> App : shotData = ''; on Update the picture is removed from the entry
end
@enduml
